WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two viewers see the same crash footage.
They leave with different answers.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The researchers changed one word in the question:
hit became smashed.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Later, some reported broken glass.
The footage contained none.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
A convincing answer is not necessarily
an untouched memory.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
When audio advertising promises instant focus,
ask what the actual recording proved.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Start with a free twelve-minute routine.
Read independent evidence before any offer.
